Subject: [PATCH 1045/3799] soh: rename D_808AC510 -> sDLists

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the five Kakariko display lists (potion-shop, shooting-gallery and bazaar signs, construction site, shooting gallery) indexed by params & 7 in the draw function.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot01_Objects2/z_bg_spot01_objects2.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_Bg_Spot01_Objects2/z_bg_spot01_objects2.c     | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot01_Objects2/z_bg_spot01_objects2.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot01_Objects2/z_bg_spot01_objects2.c
index 98a52602e..012ef33b5 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot01_Objects2/z_bg_spot01_objects2.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot01_Objects2/z_bg_spot01_objects2.c
@@ -41,7 +41,8 @@ static InitChainEntry sInitChain[] = {
     ICHAIN_VEC3F_DIV1000(scale, 100, ICHAIN_STOP),
 };
 
-static Gfx* D_808AC510[] = {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_808AC510: the five Kakariko display lists (potion-shop, shooting-gallery and bazaar signs, construction site, shooting gallery) indexed by params & 7 in the draw function.
+static Gfx* sDLists[] = {  // was D_808AC510 [LLM:HIGH]
     gKakarikoPotionShopSignDL,   gKakarikoShootingGallerySignDL, gKakarikoBazaarSignDL,
     gKakarikoConstructionSiteDL, gKakarikoShootingGalleryDL,
 };
@@ -140,5 +141,5 @@ void BgSpot01Objects2_Update(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
 }
 
 void BgSpot01Objects2_Draw(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
-    Gfx_DrawDListOpa(play, D_808AC510[thisx->params & 7]);
+    Gfx_DrawDListOpa(play, sDLists[thisx->params & 7]);  // was D_808AC510 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
